summary:
Rep. Bennie Thompson (D-Miss.
), chair of the Select Committee to Investigate the January 6th Attack on the U.S. Capitol, joined by fellow committee members, delivers opening remarks during a hearing on the Jan. 6 investigation on Capitol Hill on June 9, 2022.
